# PROJECT: SMG CORELINK — FULLY FUNCTIONAL E-COMMERCE MVP

## 1. ROLE AND DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, and payment integration specialist.

Build a complete, production-minded Minimum Viable Product (MVP) for **SMG Corelink**, a Tanzanian-based domestic and international e-commerce and B2B trading platform.

This must be a working application, not a static website, UI demonstration, or collection of disconnected dashboards.

Every major feature must connect to the database and perform its intended function.

The application must support:
- Domestic Tanzanian customers.
- International customers.
- Retail B2C purchases.
- Wholesale and B2B purchases.
- Verified merchants and manufacturers.
- Platform administrators.
- Order management and logistics.
- Dual-currency pricing in TZS and USD.

Build the application in modular phases while maintaining one consistent architecture.

